  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Coffee_Kiosk?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/92/Coffee_Kiosk.png/revision/latest?cb=20250925201210\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Coffee Kiosk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coffee Kiosk\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Coffee Kiosk</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Machine</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 42</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 75,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  1 d 12 h</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 slot(s)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2×2</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 57</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Coffee Kiosk</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">production building</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/level-18985\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">level</a> 42.\n</p><p>It is used to make <a href=\"/wiki/espresso-2425\" title=\"Espresso\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">espressos</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/caff%C3%A8-latte-2442\" title=\"Caffè Latte\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">caffè lattes</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/caff%C3%A8-mocha-2486\" title=\"Caffè Mocha\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">caffè mochas</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/caramel-latte-29354\" title=\"Caramel Latte\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">caramel lattes</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/hot-chocolate-2456\" title=\"Hot Chocolate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">hot chocolates</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/iced-banana-latte-26441\" title=\"Iced Banana Latte\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iced banana lattes</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/raspberry-mocha-2499\" title=\"Raspberry Mocha\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">raspberry mochas</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p>The Coffee Kiosk is a small wooden hut with a coffee cup logo on its black roof, and white painted sides. Cups and coffee machines are placed inside it and on its counter. A chair and a table are placed in front of it.\n</p><p>The mastered version gets a star on its front, and a flowerbed on its side.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Building</b></span></h3>\n<p>It costs 75,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and takes 1 day and 12 hours (or 57 <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>) to build the Coffee Kiosk. It gives players 35 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> when completed.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Products</b></span></h3>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/espresso-2425\" title=\"Espresso\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Espresso\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/caff%C3%A8-latte-2442\" title=\"Caffè latte\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Caffè latte\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/caff%C3%A8-mocha-2486\" title=\"Caffè mocha\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Caffè mocha\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/espresso-2425\" title=\"Espresso\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Espresso</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/caff%C3%A8-latte-2442\" title=\"Caffè Latte\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Caffè Latte</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/caff%C3%A8-mocha-2486\" title=\"Caffè Mocha\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Caffè Mocha</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 42\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 43\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 45\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 min\n</td>\n<td>10 min\n</td>\n<td>15 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>★★★ 4 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 8 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 12 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>2<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>2<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>248<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>219<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>291<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>29<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>26<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>35<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/raspberry-mocha-2499\" title=\"Raspberry mocha\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Raspberry mocha\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/hot-chocolate-2456\" title=\"Hot chocolate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Hot chocolate\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/caramel-latte-29354\" title=\"Caramel latte\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Caramel latte\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/raspberry-mocha-2499\" title=\"Raspberry Mocha\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Raspberry Mocha</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/hot-chocolate-2456\" title=\"Hot Chocolate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hot Chocolate</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/caramel-latte-29354\" title=\"Caramel Latte\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Caramel Latte</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 46\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 47\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 62\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30 min\n</td>\n<td>25 min\n</td>\n<td>15 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>★★★ 25 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 21 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 12 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>3<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>2<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>259<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>316<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>345<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>31<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>38<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>41<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/iced-banana-latte-26441\" title=\"Iced banana latte\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Iced banana latte\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/iced-banana-latte-26441\" title=\"Iced Banana Latte\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Iced Banana Latte</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 88\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20 min\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>★★★ 17 min\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>277<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>33<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Production Buildings</a></i>\n</p><p>The Coffee Kiosk originally has two slots available. Unlocking the third slot costs 6 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>. Players can unlock 7 new slots in total, each new one costing 3 more <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> than the previous one. Alternatively, they can spend a total of 105 <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> to completely upgrade their machine.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Mastering</b></span></h3>\n<p>A total of 1,270 hours of production is required to <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">master</a> the Coffee Kiosk:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/61/Coffee_Kiosk_Mastered.png/revision/latest?cb=20250925201331\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Mastered Coffee Kiosk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastered Coffee Kiosk\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><b>★<br>70 hrs</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>★★<br>240 hrs</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>★★★<br>960 hrs</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a5/Mastery_I.png/revision/latest?cb=20260602234714\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastery I\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"61\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/36/Mastery_II_5.png/revision/latest?cb=20260605002649\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastery II 5\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"63\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/21/Coffee_Kiosk_Mastery.png/revision/latest?cb=20180501173236\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coffee Kiosk Mastery\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><span title=\"10% more coins for truck orders\">+10% <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><span title=\"5% more experience points for truck orders\">+5% <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></b>\n</td>\n<td><b>15% faster</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>The Coffee Kiosk is very hard to master as all its products take very little time to make. The only way to do it a little more quickly is to unlock more slots and to make it work as often as possible.</li>\n<li>Most beverages made in the Coffee Kiosk require <a href=\"/wiki/white-sugar-2096\" title=\"White Sugar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">white sugar</a> and/or <a href=\"/wiki/cream-2315\" title=\"Cream\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cream</a>. Make sure you have a steady supply of these if you want to be able to use it.</li>\n<li>Only Iced banana latte (Unlocked at level 88) doesn't require any <a href=\"/wiki/white-sugar-2096\" title=\"White Sugar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">white sugar</a> and/or <a href=\"/wiki/cream-2315\" title=\"Cream\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cream</a>. Make sure to keep producing it a lot if you want to master your machine quickly.</li>\n<li>The Coffee Kiosk is one of the least profitable production building, with its highest maximum profit being 13 coins (raspberry mocha). That means that if you’re planning on saving up money, it is advisable to use your white sugar and cream for the production of more profitable products.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Production Buildings</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/bakery-3545\" title=\"Bakery\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bakery</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/bath-kiosk-34840\" title=\"Bath Kiosk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bath Kiosk</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/bbq-grill-3552\" title=\"BBQ Grill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BBQ Grill</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/cake-oven-3556\" title=\"Cake Oven\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cake Oven</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/candle-maker-16469\" title=\"Candle Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candle Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/candy-machine-3565\" title=\"Candy Machine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candy Machine</a> • <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Coffee Kiosk</strong> • <a href=\"/wiki/cupcake-maker-35636\" title=\"Cupcake Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cupcake Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/dairy-3547\" title=\"Dairy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Dairy</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/deep-fryer-33952\" title=\"Deep Fryer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">De